  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP/Idea: Partier fas 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP/Idea: Parties 2 - UNDP/Evaluation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta st&#xf6;d inbegriper tre projekt vilka samtliga syftar till att st&#xf6;da det bolivanska politiska systemet. Det st&#xf6;rsta projektet (vilket drivs av UNDP och Idea) syftar till partist&#xe4;rkande verksamhet. De tv&#xe5; mindre projekten handlar om att stimulera politisk debatt och tolerans (f f a mellan ungdomar).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project contains three different components that all aim to support the Bolivian political system. The largest project (proposed by UNDP and Idea) is aimed at strengthening the Bolivian political parties. The two smaller projects aim to stimulate political debate and tolerance (particularly among youth).</narrative>
  </description>
